<title>USA: Central Union HSD, Calif., won by Piper Jaffray Inc. [CORRECTED 23:05 GMT]</title>
<headline>Central Union HSD, Calif., won by Piper Jaffray Inc. [CORRECTED 23:05 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects winner of bonds in headline and text from PaineWebber to Piper Jaffray.)</p>
<p>Piper Jaffray Inc., said it won $5.150 million of Central Union HSD, Calif., 1993 general obligation bonds, Series B, with a true interest cost of 5.5649 percent (corrects from 5.574 percent).</p>
</text>
